WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.533
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.533 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.367 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.867
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.867 --> 00:49.367
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.133 --> 00:54.900
[jazzy suspenseful music]
【爵士悬疑音乐】

00:54.900 --> 00:57.300
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:57.300 --> 01:00.500
[dramatic jazzy
flourish]
[戏剧爵士乐
蓬勃发展]

01:00.500 --> 01:01.333
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]
[bbbbbbbb]

01:01.333 --> 01:02.933
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

01:02.933 --> 01:06.433
[brakes screeching]
[overlapping chatter]
[刹车声]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

01:06.433 --> 01:08.533
- Ah!
- Oh!
- 啊！
- 哦！

01:08.533 --> 01:11.133
I suggested having this lesson
in the cemetery
我建议上这堂课
在墓地里

01:11.133 --> 01:14.067
because I thought you
couldn't kill anyone here.
因为我以为你
这里无法杀死任何人。

01:14.067 --> 01:17.767
But now I'm afraid
you're disturbing the dead!
但现在我害怕
你扰乱了死者！

01:17.767 --> 01:18.700
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

01:19.933 --> 01:22.500
[splotch]
[gasps] Before they bury me,
[斑点]
[喘息]在他们埋葬我之前，

01:22.500 --> 01:24.867
get me to a pay phone.
带我去公用电话。

01:27.833 --> 01:29.467
[muffled cries]
[低沉的哭声]

01:29.467 --> 01:32.467
I need to call
another instructor for you.
我需要打电话
另一位教练为您服务。

01:32.467 --> 01:36.200
I just...can't...
take it anymore!
我只是……不能……
别再这样了！

01:38.733 --> 01:39.933
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

01:41.367 --> 01:42.900
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

01:42.900 --> 01:44.400
[Mrs. Puff whimpering]
[太太。噗噗呜咽]

01:44.400 --> 01:47.500
both: Aah! Ah! Uhh!
两人：啊啊！啊!呃！

01:50.900 --> 01:53.967
- Huh? You stopped in
front of the prison?
- 啊？你停在
监狱前面？

01:53.967 --> 01:59.500
Never mind! Any place is better
than in this boat with you!
没关系！任何地方都比较好
胜过和你一起在这条船上！

01:59.500 --> 02:02.233
[muttering, whimpering]
[低语，呜咽]

02:02.233 --> 02:04.900
[alarms blaring]
[overlapping shouting]
[警报响起]
[重叠的喊叫]

02:04.900 --> 02:06.833
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

02:06.833 --> 02:09.567
- What are ya waiting for?
Step on it!
- 你还在等什么？
踩它！

02:09.567 --> 02:11.667
- You must be the new
driving instructor.
- 你一定是新来的
驾驶教练。

02:11.667 --> 02:14.667
[alarms continue blaring]
[shouting continues]
[警报继续响起]
[喊叫声继续]

02:14.667 --> 02:17.500
Student driver.
That's me.
学生司机。
这就是我。

02:17.500 --> 02:21.200
I just don't take
a bad picture, do I?
我只是不接受
一张糟糕的照片，是吗？

02:21.200 --> 02:22.867
- Uh, yeah, yeah, sure.
- 呃，是的，是的，当然。

02:22.867 --> 02:25.067
I'm your new
driving instructor.
我是你的新人
驾驶教练。

02:25.067 --> 02:27.867
- Great! Look at how I can
tune the radio.
- 伟大的！看看我怎样才能
调收音机。

02:27.867 --> 02:28.967
[static]
[静止的]

02:28.967 --> 02:30.567
- Breaking News!
both: Huh?
- 突发新闻！
两人：啊？

02:30.567 --> 02:32.067
- Notorious criminal
Sticky Fins Whiting
- 臭名昭著的罪犯
粘鳍鳕鱼

02:32.067 --> 02:34.433
has just escaped from prison.
刚刚越狱。

02:34.433 --> 02:37.067
- Very good
radio tuning skills.
- 非常好
无线电调谐技巧。

02:37.067 --> 02:39.400
Now,
drive as fast as you can!
现在，
尽可能快地开车！

02:39.400 --> 02:41.933
[alarms continue blaring]
[警报继续响起]

02:41.933 --> 02:43.733
- Stop! SpongeBob!
- 停止！海绵宝宝！

02:43.733 --> 02:45.367
Come back!
回来！

02:45.367 --> 02:49.067
[gasps] I can't believe
I said that!
[喘气]我不敢相信
我说过了！

02:49.067 --> 02:50.333
[engine revs, brakes squeal]
[发动机转速、刹车尖叫声]

02:50.333 --> 02:52.067
- Sticky Fins,
where are you?
- 粘鳍，
你在哪里？

02:52.067 --> 02:53.867
I can't be that late.
我不能这么晚。

02:53.867 --> 02:55.167
- Follow that sponge!
- 跟着那块海绵！

02:55.167 --> 02:56.633
- You ain't Sticky Fins.
- 你不是粘鳍。

02:56.633 --> 02:58.400
- And you ain't
a chocolate cake!
- 而你不是
巧克力蛋糕！

02:58.400 --> 03:00.067
Now, step on it!
现在，踩吧！

03:00.067 --> 03:02.500
- Yes, ma'am!
Dorsal Dan at your service!
- 是的，女士！
多萨尔丹竭诚为您服务！

03:02.500 --> 03:05.167
[police alarms blaring]
[wheels screeching]
[警察警报响起]
[车轮吱吱作响]

03:05.167 --> 03:08.300
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

03:08.300 --> 03:10.667
- [grunts]
Oh! Oh!
- [咕哝]
哦！哦！

03:10.667 --> 03:14.067
Crater-face! We're being
followed. Lose that tail!
火山口脸！我们正在
紧随其后。失去那条尾巴！

03:14.067 --> 03:16.200
- I thought it'd made me
look cool.
- 我以为这让我
看起来很酷。

03:16.200 --> 03:17.900
Guess not.
猜猜不是。

03:17.900 --> 03:20.767
- Not that tail!
The cops behind us!
- 不是那条尾巴！
警察就在我们身后！

03:20.767 --> 03:22.333
Drive crazy!
开车疯了！

03:22.333 --> 03:24.433
- Ohhhhhh, that I can do!
- 哦哦哦，我能做到！

03:24.433 --> 03:25.700
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

03:25.700 --> 03:26.500
[pop]
[流行音乐]

03:26.500 --> 03:29.500
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:29.500 --> 03:32.067
[creak, pop]
Yah-ha-ha-ha!
[嘎吱声，流行声]
啊哈哈哈哈！

03:32.067 --> 03:33.467
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

03:33.467 --> 03:36.800
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

03:36.800 --> 03:38.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:38.067 --> 03:40.733
- Wow! He's driving
like a psycho!
- 哇！他正在开车
像个神经病！

03:40.733 --> 03:42.200
Who taught him
how to drive?
谁教他的
怎么开车？

03:42.200 --> 03:44.567
- [nervous giggle]
- [紧张的咯咯笑]

03:48.333 --> 03:51.200
- [sucking sounds]
Good baby?
- [吸吮声音]
好宝贝吗？

03:51.200 --> 03:53.833
- Waaaaaahhhhh!
- 哇啊啊啊啊！

03:53.833 --> 03:56.500
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:56.500 --> 03:58.700
- Gosh!
[sputtering]
- 天哪！
[溅射]

03:58.700 --> 04:01.067
- [British accent] I say,
how's my automobiling?
- [英国口音] 我说，
我的汽车怎么样？

04:01.067 --> 04:02.933
- [British accent]
Simply smashing.
- [英国口音]
简直就是粉碎。

04:02.933 --> 04:05.633
[normal voice] You're simply
smashing into things!
[正常声音] 你简直就是
撞到东西！

04:05.633 --> 04:07.067
[low chatter]
[低声说话]

04:07.067 --> 04:08.100
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:08.100 --> 04:10.333
Let's see what's on the menu!
让我们看看菜单上有什么！

04:10.333 --> 04:11.500
Oh! I'll take those.
哦！我会接受那些。

04:11.500 --> 04:12.600
all: Hmm?
全体：嗯？

04:12.600 --> 04:14.067
[Sticky Fingers grunts]
[粘手指咕哝]

04:14.067 --> 04:16.900
[light music]
[轻音乐]

04:16.900 --> 04:22.933
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:22.933 --> 04:25.933
- Oh! Oh-ohhh!
- 哦！噢噢噢！

04:25.933 --> 04:29.333
- Excuse me sir, I'm in the
middle of a driving lesson.
- 对不起先生，我在
驾驶课中间。

04:29.333 --> 04:32.067
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

04:32.067 --> 04:33.467
- Look out, you maniac!
- 小心，你这个疯子！

04:33.467 --> 04:36.567
[tires squeal]
[bang]
[轮胎吱吱声]
[砰]

04:39.400 --> 04:40.967
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:40.967 --> 04:43.667
- You're going the wrong way!
Turn this thing around!
- 你走错路了！
把这件事扭转过来！

04:43.667 --> 04:45.700
- You got it!
Turning around!
- 你明白了！
转身！

04:47.367 --> 04:49.400
[drivers screaming]
[司机尖叫]

04:49.400 --> 04:51.800
- Oh, you're a great instructor!
What now?
- 哦，你是一位很棒的教练！
现在怎么办？

04:51.800 --> 04:54.100
- Just...go with the flow.
- 只是...随波逐流。

04:56.400 --> 04:58.967
[light, suspenseful music]
【轻快、悬疑的音乐】

04:58.967 --> 05:01.433
- Looks like they shook us.
Don't worry, we'll find them.
- 看起来他们震撼了我们。
别担心，我们会找到他们的。

05:01.433 --> 05:04.833
- They'll probably revoke my
teacher's license for this.
- 他们可能会撤销我的
教师执照。

05:04.833 --> 05:07.800
- Hey, I'm a teacher too!
I teach all kinds of things.
- 嘿，我也是老师！
我教各种各样的东西。

05:07.800 --> 05:10.900
Safe cracking,
burglary, getaway driving.
安全破解，
盗窃、驾车逃逸。

05:10.900 --> 05:14.500
- [giggles] I did notice
you're a very good driver.
- [咯咯笑]我确实注意到了
你是一个非常好的司机。

05:14.500 --> 05:17.667
- Ha ha, you ain't such a bad
passenger yourself.
- 哈哈，你没那么坏
乘客自己。

05:17.667 --> 05:19.733
[clicks tongue]
- [giggles] Oh, my!
[咔嚓舌头]
- [咯咯笑]哦，天哪！

05:19.733 --> 05:22.667
[dramatic chords]
[戏剧和弦]

05:24.133 --> 05:26.667
- Here's your next test.
Follow me.
- 这是你的下一个测试。
跟我来。

05:27.867 --> 05:30.100
Distracted drivers
are dangerous.
分心的司机
很危险。

05:30.100 --> 05:33.533
I want you to distract that
salesman in the store.
我想让你分散注意力
商店里的推销员。

05:33.533 --> 05:36.500
- I don't understand how this is
gonna help with my driving.
- 我不明白这是怎么回事
会帮助我开车。

05:36.500 --> 05:38.700
- It's, uh...
abstract thinking.
- 这是，呃...
抽象思维。

05:38.700 --> 05:40.933
- Hey, I've heard of that!
- 嘿，我听说过！

05:43.067 --> 05:44.367
- Welcome!
- 欢迎！

05:44.367 --> 05:46.233
- Distract with the abstract.
- 用抽象来分散注意力。

05:46.233 --> 05:47.233
[snaps]
[快照]

05:47.233 --> 05:51.333
[making silly noises]
[发出愚蠢的声音]

05:51.333 --> 05:54.767
- Hey, shapes and noises!
I love it!
- 嘿，形状和声音！
我喜欢它！

05:54.767 --> 05:57.067
[SpongeBob continues
making noises]
[海绵宝宝继续
发出声音]

05:57.067 --> 05:58.467
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

05:59.567 --> 06:03.467
[chuckling]
[noises continue]
[轻笑]
[噪音继续]

06:03.467 --> 06:04.667
[beep beep]
[嘟嘟]

06:04.667 --> 06:08.367
[suspenseful jazzy music]
【悬疑的爵士音乐】

06:08.367 --> 06:09.633
- What's the next lesson?
- 下一课是什么？

06:09.633 --> 06:11.500
- The nearest
electronics store.
- 最近的
电子产品商店。

06:11.500 --> 06:13.933
- Oh, you really know how to
challenge a guy.
- 哦，你真的知道怎么做
挑战一个人。

06:16.767 --> 06:19.200
[police sirens wailing]
[警笛鸣响]

06:20.667 --> 06:23.833
- Help! Help!
I've been robbed!
- 帮助！帮助！
我被抢了！

06:23.833 --> 06:25.433
- I've shopped in that place
before,
- 我在那个地方购物过
之前，

06:25.433 --> 06:27.433
and I've been robbed too.
而且我也被抢劫了。

06:27.433 --> 06:29.300
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

06:29.300 --> 06:31.533
- What now, beautiful?
- I wouldn't mind
- 现在怎么办，美丽？
- 我不介意

06:31.533 --> 06:35.067
seeing you navigate
a four-way stop.
看到你导航
四路停靠站。

06:35.067 --> 06:37.433
- Romance always has
the right of way.
- 浪漫总是有的
通行权。

06:37.433 --> 06:39.133
- Oh, my!
- 哦，天哪！

06:39.133 --> 06:41.133
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

06:41.133 --> 06:43.633
[light music plays]
[轻音乐响起]

06:43.633 --> 06:45.100
- Ah!
Wha--
- 啊！
世界卫生大会 -

06:45.100 --> 06:46.700
Oop.
哎呀。

06:46.700 --> 06:49.133
[random sounds continue]
[随机声音继续]

06:49.133 --> 06:50.267
Whoa!
哇！

06:52.467 --> 06:54.833
[seat mechanism whining]
[座椅机构发出呜呜声]

06:54.833 --> 06:56.667
[click]
[mechanism whining]
[点击]
[机制哀鸣]

06:56.667 --> 06:59.600
[intense percussive music]
[激烈的打击乐]

06:59.600 --> 07:01.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:01.067 --> 07:03.467
- I need to launder
these bills--fast!
- 我需要洗衣服
这些账单——快！

07:03.467 --> 07:04.900
- I know just the place!
- 我只知道那个地方！

07:04.900 --> 07:06.267
But first,
let me adjust your seat.
但首先，
让我调整一下你的座位。

07:06.267 --> 07:07.500
- Ooh!
- 哦！

07:07.500 --> 07:09.433
Hey! What's the big idea?
嘿！有什么大创意？

07:09.433 --> 07:10.967
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

07:10.967 --> 07:14.533
[SpongeBob laughing,
making noises]
[海绵宝宝笑了，
发出声音]

07:14.533 --> 07:17.533
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

07:17.533 --> 07:21.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:21.733 --> 07:24.633
- What is wrong with you?
- 你怎么了？

07:27.300 --> 07:29.333
- I think your sponge should be
around here somewhere.
- 我认为你的海绵应该是
就在这附近的某个地方。

07:29.333 --> 07:32.233
- [gasps] I didn't even
feel you slow down.
- [喘气]我什至没有
感觉你放慢了速度。

07:32.233 --> 07:35.967
You've got such a gentle foot
on the pedal.
你的脚如此温柔
在踏板上。

07:35.967 --> 07:40.367
- Gosh. No one's ever said
I had a gentle foot before.
- 天哪。从来没有人说过
我以前的脚很温柔。

07:40.367 --> 07:41.967
- Oh-ho.
- 哦嗬。

07:41.967 --> 07:43.633
Oh! Oh!
哦！哦！

07:43.633 --> 07:45.067
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

07:46.200 --> 07:47.200
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:47.200 --> 07:49.533
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

07:49.533 --> 07:50.933
[horn beeping]
[喇叭声]

07:50.933 --> 07:53.067
- Why's that jerk honking?
- 那个混蛋为什么按喇叭？

07:53.067 --> 07:55.233
Go! Drive!
去！驾驶！

07:56.600 --> 07:58.567
- Sorry about
your gentle foot!
- 抱歉
你温柔的脚！

07:58.567 --> 08:00.833
Hi-yah!
- Hey--Owww!
嗨呀！
- 嘿 - 噢！

08:04.700 --> 08:05.767
- Oh!
- 哦！

08:05.767 --> 08:08.167
Ooh, driving Range!
哦，练习场！

08:09.567 --> 08:11.200
- Oh--oh!
- 哦——哦！

08:11.200 --> 08:15.433
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:15.433 --> 08:16.633
- How's my driving?
- 我的驾驶技术怎么样？

08:16.633 --> 08:17.633
[bonk]
- Oh!
[棒棒哒]
- 哦！

08:17.633 --> 08:19.400
Doh-doh-doh-doh-doh--
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟——

08:21.067 --> 08:23.900
- Doh! That kinda hurts,
don't ya think?
- 噢！那个有点疼，
你不觉得吗？

08:23.900 --> 08:25.333
- Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
- 噢！噢！噢！噢！

08:29.233 --> 08:30.533
Pfffffttt!
噗噗噗！

08:30.533 --> 08:34.167
For the love of Neptune,
let's get outta here!
为了海王星的爱，
我们离开这里吧！

08:34.167 --> 08:36.533
- [hums] Uh-huh.
Uh-huh, uh-huh.
- [哼哼] 嗯嗯。
嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

08:36.533 --> 08:39.200
Oh!
哦！

08:39.200 --> 08:40.433
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

08:40.433 --> 08:41.800
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

08:46.233 --> 08:47.733
- Aah!
Ha ha!
- 啊啊！
哈哈！

08:47.733 --> 08:49.067
[whomp]
[重击]

08:49.067 --> 08:50.267
Ooh!
哦！

08:50.267 --> 08:51.267
Ow!
噢！

08:51.267 --> 08:52.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:52.467 --> 08:54.267
Oh!
[dinging]
哦！
[叮叮]

08:54.267 --> 08:55.400
[teeth clattering]
[牙齿格格作响]

08:55.400 --> 08:57.600
Ooh--ow!
[sobbing]
噢——噢！
[抽泣]

08:57.600 --> 08:58.900
Aaaaaaaah!
啊啊啊啊！

09:03.433 --> 09:06.867
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:06.867 --> 09:09.133
I just wanna know...
我只是想知道...

09:09.133 --> 09:12.433
what'd I ever do
to deserve this?
我曾经做过什么
值得这样吗？

09:12.433 --> 09:15.333
- Would you like to test me
on road signs now?
- 你想考验我吗
现在在路标上吗？

09:15.333 --> 09:18.133
Let's see...
[Sticky Fins continues sobbing]
让我们看看...
[粘鳍继续抽泣]

09:18.133 --> 09:19.533
"Stop,"
“停止，”

09:19.533 --> 09:20.733
"No Left Turn,"
“禁止左转”

09:20.733 --> 09:22.267
and that one over there
that says
那边那个
那说

09:22.267 --> 09:23.867
"Falling Rocks!!!"
“落石！！！”

09:23.867 --> 09:25.700
- Wait, what?
Ooh!
- 等等，什么？
哦！

09:25.700 --> 09:26.933
[wham]
Oof!
[重击]
噢！

09:26.933 --> 09:29.267
[loopy music]
[疯狂的音乐]

09:29.267 --> 09:30.833
[bam]
Whoa!
[嘭]
哇！

09:32.233 --> 09:33.500
- Mm-mm-mm-mm--
- 嗯-毫米-毫米-毫米--

09:33.500 --> 09:35.100
[engine revs]
Oh!
[发动机转速]
哦！

09:35.100 --> 09:36.400
- Aaaaahhhh!
- 啊啊啊！

09:36.400 --> 09:37.467
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

09:37.467 --> 09:40.467
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

09:40.467 --> 09:41.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:41.733 --> 09:43.367
- [gasps] SpongeBob!
- [喘气]海绵宝宝！

09:43.367 --> 09:44.600
- Mrs. Puff!
- 泡芙夫人！

09:44.600 --> 09:45.633
- Sticky Fins!
- 粘鳍！

09:45.633 --> 09:47.100
- Dorsal Dan!
- 背丹！

09:47.100 --> 09:49.500
Help meeeee!
帮帮我吧！

09:49.500 --> 09:51.200
- Hey, Mrs. Puff!
The new instructor's been
- 嘿，帕夫夫人！
新来的导师是

09:51.200 --> 09:53.567
teaching me so much.
Not as much as you.
教了我很多。
没有你那么多。

09:53.567 --> 09:55.167
But y'know, different things.
但你知道，不同的事情。

09:55.167 --> 09:58.867
- SpongeBob, you gotta keep
your eyes on the road!
- 海绵宝宝，你必须保留
你的眼睛在路上！

09:58.867 --> 10:00.733
- He hasn't taught me
that one yet!
- 他没有教过我
还没那个呢！

10:00.733 --> 10:01.867
Oh!
哦！

10:03.567 --> 10:05.400
- Oh!
- Ah!
- 哦！
- 啊！

10:05.400 --> 10:08.967
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

10:08.967 --> 10:11.267
- Ah! Get me outta here!
- 啊！带我离开这里！

10:11.267 --> 10:12.300
[growling]
[咆哮]

10:12.300 --> 10:14.100
- Aww,
you must be hungry.
- 哇哦，
你一定饿了。

10:14.100 --> 10:15.967
I've got some of
Gary's Snail Snacks.
我有一些
加里的蜗牛零食。

10:20.233 --> 10:21.367
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

10:21.367 --> 10:23.733
- This is the police.
Pull over!
- 这是警察。
套衫！

10:23.733 --> 10:27.133
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

10:27.133 --> 10:29.667
- Right turn!
Make a right turn!
- 右转！
右转！

10:29.667 --> 10:31.633
- Aye, aye, professor!
- 是啊，是啊，教授！

10:31.633 --> 10:37.333
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:37.333 --> 10:38.467
[whomp]
[重击]

10:38.467 --> 10:40.867
Yes! I'm back!
是的！我回来了！

10:40.867 --> 10:42.967
[kissing] Thank Neptune!
[亲吻] 感谢海王星！

10:42.967 --> 10:44.733
Don't let me out
ever again!
别让我出去
再来一次！

10:44.733 --> 10:46.167
It's not safe out there!
外面不安全！

10:46.167 --> 10:49.433
Lock me away!
Forever, and ever!
把我锁起来！
永永远远！

10:49.433 --> 10:50.900
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

10:53.933 --> 10:57.167
- Warden, I found this one
pulling up outside the prison.
- 典狱长，我找到了这个
把车停在监狱外面。

10:57.167 --> 10:59.767
- Dorsal Dan! The notorious
getaway driver.
- 背丹！臭名昭著的
逃跑的司机。

10:59.767 --> 11:01.467
Toss him in the clink!
把他扔进叮当声里！

11:01.467 --> 11:03.167
[jazzy musical flourish]
[爵士音乐的蓬勃发展]

11:03.167 --> 11:05.433
- [crying] I'll wait for you,
- [哭泣]我会等你，

11:05.433 --> 11:07.600
my little tenderfoot!
我的小嫩脚！

11:07.600 --> 11:09.667
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

11:09.667 --> 11:11.467
- Aaaaaah!
- 啊啊啊！

11:11.467 --> 11:13.400
Whoa!
哇！

11:13.400 --> 11:15.133
Hey, where'd
the new instructor go?
嘿，去哪儿了
新导师去哪了？

11:15.133 --> 11:16.833
Oh, well, I still
have ten minutes left
哦，好吧，我还是
还剩十分钟

11:16.833 --> 11:18.700
on my driving lesson.
在我的驾驶课上。

11:18.700 --> 11:20.867
[singsong]
Oh, Mrs. Puff?
[单曲]
哦，帕夫夫人？

11:20.867 --> 11:23.433
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

11:23.433 --> 11:24.867
Oh...waaaah!
噢...哇啊啊！

11:24.867 --> 11:26.767
I'll confess to anything!
我什么都会坦白！

11:26.767 --> 11:28.600
Throw away the key!
扔掉钥匙！

11:28.600 --> 11:31.333
It's not safe out here!
这里不安全！

11:31.333 --> 11:34.433
Let me in!
让我进去！

11:36.400 --> 11:40.433
all: Drive safely,
and always wear your seat belt!
全部：安全驾驶，
并始终系好安全带！

全部：安全驾驶，
并始终系好安全带！